WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
Minus 5 to 8 degrees. How big is that jump?

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.470
Don't subtract the numbers you see. Count to zero first.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.120
From minus 5, that is 5 steps up to zero.

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.750
Then 8 more steps to reach 8.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:21.013
5 plus 8. The temperature rose 13 degrees.
